#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, intoPageLabel)
#. +> trunk stable
#: indi/telescopewizard.ui:163
msgid ""
"Welcome to the <b>KStars Telescope Setup Wizard!</b>\n"
"<br>"
"<br>"
"\n"
"This Wizard will help you to connect to your telescope and control it from KStars. You will be asked to verify some basic information.\n"
"<br>"
"\n"
"<br>"
"You can get extended information on telescope support in KStars by pressing the <tt>help</tt> button at any point during the Wizard.\n"
"<br>"
"<br>"
"\n"
"Please click next to continue."
msgstr ""
"Willkamen bi den <b>Teleskoop-Inrichthölper vun KStars!</b>\n"
"<br>"
"<br>"
"\n"
"Disse Hölper ünnerstütt Di bi't Tokoppeln na Dien Teleskoop un bi't Stüern vun dat Deert mit KStars. Du muttst en poor Grundinformatschonen pröven.\n"
"<br>"
"\n"
"<br>"
"Mehr Informatschonen över de Teleskoop-Ünnerstütten vun KStars laat sik jümmers mit en Klick op den <tt>Hülp</tt>-Knoop halen, wielt de Hölper löppt.\n"
"<br>"
"<br>"
"\n"
"Bitte klick op \"Nakamen\", wenn Du wiedermaken wullt."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, modelPageLabel)
#. +> trunk stable
#: indi/telescopewizard.ui:199
msgid ""
"<h3>1. Telescope Model</h3>"
"\n"
"\n"
"Please select your telescope model from the list below. Click next after selecting a model."
msgstr ""
"<h3>1. Teleskoop-Modell</h3>"
"\n"
"\n"
"Bitte söök nerrn Dien Teleskoop ut. Klick op \"Nakamen\", wenn Du en Modell utsöcht hest."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, textLabel1)
#. +> trunk stable
#: indi/telescopewizard.ui:274
msgid ""
"<b>Tip</b>\n"
"<br>"
"Some non-Meade telescopes support a subset of the LX200 command set. Select <tt>LX200 Basic</tt> to control such devices."
msgstr ""
"<b>Tipp</b>\n"
"<br>"
"En Reeg vun Teleskopen, de nich vun \"Meade\" sünd, ünnerstütt liekers de LX200-Befehlen deelwies. Söök <tt>LX200 Basic</tt> ut, wenn Du so en Reedschap stüern wullt."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, telescopePageInfo)
#. +> trunk stable
#: indi/telescopewizard.ui:313
msgid ""
"<h3>2. Align Your Telescope</h3>"
"\n"
"\n"
"You need to align your telescope before you can control it properly from KStars. Please refer to your telescope manual for alignment instructions.\n"
"<br>"
"<br>"
"\n"
"After a successful alignment, connect your telescope's RS232 interface to your computer's serial or USB port.\n"
"<br>"
"<br>"
"<br>"
"Click next to continue."
msgstr ""
"<h3>2. Dien Teleskoop utrichten</h3>"
"\n"
"\n"
"Ehr Du Dien Teleskoop richtig mit KStars stüern kannst, muttst Du dat utrichten. Bitte kiek, wat dor Dien Teleskoop-Handbook över seggt.\n"
"<br>"
"<br>"
"\n"
"Wenn Dien Teleskoop utricht is, koppel de RS-232-Koppelsteed vun Dien Teleskoop na de serielle oder USB-Koppelsteed vun Dien Reekner to.\n"
"<br>"
"<br>"
"<br>"
"Klick op \"Nakamen\", wenn Du wiedermaken wullt."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, localPageLabel)
#. +> trunk stable
#: indi/telescopewizard.ui:347
msgid ""
"<h3>3. Verify Local Settings</h3>"
"\n"
"\n"
"Verify if the following time, date, and location settings are correct. If any of the settings are incorrect, you can correct them via the <tt>Set time</tt> and <tt>Set Location</tt> buttons.\n"
msgstr ""
"<h3>3. Lokale Instellen överpröven</h3>"
"\n"
"\n"
"Överprööv, wat de nakamen Angaven för Tiet, Datum un Standoort passt. Wenn een dorvun falsch is, kannst Du ehr över de Knööp <tt>Tiet instellen</tt> oder <tt>Oort instellen</tt> ännern.\n"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, locationLabel)
#. +> trunk stable
#: indi/telescopewizard.ui:410
msgid "<b>Location</b>"
msgstr "<b>Standoort</b>"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, timeLabel)
#. +> trunk stable
#: indi/telescopewizard.ui:453
msgid "<b>Time</b>"
msgstr "<b>Tiet</b>"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, dateLabel)
#. +> trunk stable
#: indi/telescopewizard.ui:460
msgid "<b>Date</b>"
msgstr "<b>Datum</b>"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QPushButton, setTimeB)
#. +> trunk stable
#: indi/telescopewizard.ui:477
msgid "Set Time..."
msgstr "Tiet instellen..."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QPushButton, setLocationB)
#. +> trunk stable
#: indi/telescopewizard.ui:484
msgid "Set Location..."
msgstr "Standoort instellen..."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, portPageLabel)
#. +> trunk stable
#: indi/telescopewizard.ui:538
msgid ""
"<h3>4. Determine Connection Port</h3>"
"\n"
"\n"
"Enter the port number your telescope is connected to. If you only have one serial port in your computer, the port is usually <tt>/dev/ttyS0</tt>\n"
"<br>"
"<br>"
"If you are unsure about the port number, you can leave the field empty and KStars will try to scan the ports for attached telescopes. Beware that the autoscan process might take a few minutes to complete. "
msgstr ""
"<h3>4. Koppelsteed rutfinnen</h3>"
"\n"
"\n"
"Giff de Nummer vun de Koppelsteed in, na de dat Teleskoop tokoppelt is. Wenn Du bloots een seriell Koppelsteed an Dien Reekner hest, is disse Koppelsteed normalerwies <tt>/dev/ttyS0</tt>.\n"
"<br>"
"<br>"
"Wenn Du de Koppelsteednummer nich seker weetst, laat dit Feld leddig; KStars kiekt denn de Koppelsteden na tokoppelt Teleskopen dör. Beacht, dat de Söök en poor Minuten duern kann. "

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, portLabel)
#. +> trunk stable
#: indi/telescopewizard.ui:575
msgid "<b>Port:</b>"
msgstr "<b>Koppelsteed:</b>"

