#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, WelcomeText)
#. +> trunk stable
#: tools/obslistwizard.ui:33
msgid ""
"<html><head></head><body>"
"<p>Welcome to the Observing List Wizard</p>"
"<p></p>"
"<p>With this tool, you can construct an observing list by filtering the list of all objects in various ways.  First, you will select objects by <span style=\" font-weight:600;\">type</span>.  Next, you can select only those objects which occupy a specific <span style=\" font-weight:600;\">region on the sky</span>.  You can further trim the observing list by selecting objects in a specified <span style=\" font-weight:600;\">magnitude range</span>.  Finally, you can choose to keep only those objects which are <span style=\" font-weight:600;\">observable on a particular date</span>.</p>"
"<p></p>"
"<p>Press the <span style=\" font-weight:600;\">Next</span> button to get started by selecting which object types you would like to be present in your observing list.</p>"
"</body></html>"
msgstr ""
"<html><head></head><body>"
"<p>Willkamen bi den Hölper för de Kieklist</p>"
"<p></p>"
"<p>Mit dit Warktüüch kannst Du en Kieklist opstellen, wenn Du de List mit all Objekten op verscheden Oorden filtern deist. Toeerst söchst Du Objekten na <span style=\" font-weight:600;\">Typ</span> ut.  Dor na kannst Du Objekten ut en fastleggt <span style=\" font-weight:600;\">Hevenrebeet</span> utsöken. Du kannst de Kieklist wieder topassen, wenn Du Objekten binnen fastleggt <span style=\" font-weight:600;\">Magnituud-Grenzen</span> söchst.  Tolest kannst Du fastleggen, dat Du bloots Objekten hebben wullt, de <span style=\" font-weight:600;\">op en besünner Dag sichtbor</span> sünd.</p>"
"<p></p>"
"<p>Klick op <span style=\" font-weight:600;\">Nakamen</span>, wenn Du de Objekttypen fastleggen wullt, de op Dien List wesen schöölt.</p>"
"</body></html>"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, ObjTypeLabel)
#. +> trunk stable
#: tools/obslistwizard.ui:56
msgid ""
"<html><head></head><body>"
"<p>Select objects by type</p>"
"<p></p>"
"<p>Highlight the object types you want to include in your observing list in the box below.  You can highlight more than one item in the list.  The buttons along the right can be used to quickly choose some common selections.</p>"
"<p></p>"
"<p>When you are finished, press the <span style=\" font-weight:600;\">Next</span> button.</p>"
"</body></html>"
msgstr ""
"<html><head></head><body>"
"<p>Objekten na Typ utsöken</p>"
"<p></p>"
"<p>Söök nerrn de Objekttypen ut, de Du op Dien Kieklist hebben wullt.  Du kannst mehr as een Listindrag utsöken.  Mit de Knööp rechterhand kannst Du en Reeg faken bruukt Kören utsöken.</p>"
"<p></p>"
"<p>Wenn Du fardig büst, klick op <span style=\" font-weight:600;\">Nakamen</span>.</p>"
"</body></html>"

