#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, RegionSelectText)
#. +> trunk stable
#: tools/obslistwizard.ui:214
msgid ""
"<html><head></head><body>"
"<p>Select by region</p>"
"<p></p>"
"<p>Next, you can limit your object list to only those objects which occupy a specific region on the sky.  There are three ways to specify the region for your list:  by <span style=\" font-weight:600;\">constellation</span>, by specifying a <span style=\" font-weight:600;\">rectangular region</span>, or by specifying a <span style=\" font-weight:600;\">circular region</span>.  You may also skip selecting by a region, which will include objects from <span style=\" font-weight:600;\">all over the sky</span>.</p>"
"<p></p>"
"<p>Make your selection below, and press <span style=\" font-weight:600;\">Next</span>.</p>"
"</body></html>"
msgstr ""
"<html><head></head><body>"
"<p>Na Rebeet utsöken</p>"
"<p></p>"
"<p>Nu kannst Du Dien Objektenlist op de Objekten ingrenzen, de sik binnen en fastleggt Hevenrebeet finnen laat.  Du kannst dat Rebeet op dree Oorden angeven: na <span style=\" font-weight:600;\">Steernbild</span>, mit en <span style=\" font-weight:600;\">rechteckig Rebeet</span>, oder mit en <span style=\" font-weight:600;\">Krinkrebeet</span>.  Du kannst de Köör na Rebeet ok utlaten, denn warrt Objekten vun den  <span style=\" font-weight:600;\">helen Heven</span> utsöcht.</p>"
"<p></p>"
"<p>Söök Dien Objekten nerrn ut, denn klick op <span style=\" font-weight:600;\">Nakamen</span>.</p>"
"</body></html>"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, RegionSelectLabel)
#. +> trunk stable
#: tools/obslistwizard.ui:240
msgid "I wish to select objects:"
msgstr "Objektköör:"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, ConstellationText)
#. +> trunk stable
#: tools/obslistwizard.ui:320
msgid ""
"<html><head></head><body>"
"<p>Select objects in one or more constellations</p>"
"<p></p>"
"<p>In the list below, highlight the constellations you want to use for your observing list.  Only objects that occupy the selected constellations will be included in the list.</p>"
"<p></p>"
"<p>When you are finished, press <span style=\" font-weight:600;\">Next</span> to continue.</p>"
"</body></html>"
msgstr ""
"<html><head></head><body>"
"<p>Objekten in een oder mehr Steernbiller utsöken</p>"
"<p></p>"
"<p>Söök op de List nerrn de Steernbiller ut, de Du för Dien Köör bruken wullt.  Bloots Objekten ut de angeven Steernbiller warrt na de List opnahmen.</p>"
"<p></p>"
"<p>Klick op <span style=\" font-weight:600;\">Nakamen</span>, wenn du fardig büst un wiedermaken wullt.</p>"
"</body></html>"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, RectangularRegionText)
#. +> trunk stable
#: tools/obslistwizard.ui:347
msgid ""
"<html><head></head><body>"
"<p>Select objects in a rectangular region</p>"
"<p></p>"
"<p>On this page, you can limit your observing list to those objects which occupy a particular rectangular region on the sky.  Specify the rectangular region by selecting the right ascension (RA) and declination (Dec) limits that define the region.</p>"
"<p></p>"
"<p>When you are finished, press <span style=\" font-weight:600;\">Next</span> to continue.</p>"
"</body></html>"
msgstr ""
"<html><head></head><body>"
"<p>Objekten ut en Rechteckrebeet utsöken</p>"
"<p></p>"
"<p>Op disse Siet kannst Du Dien Kieklist op Objekten ut en besünner rechteckig Hevenrebeet ingrenzen. Dat Rebeet giffts Du mit de Rektaszenschoon (Rek) un de Deklinatschoon (Dek) vun de Grenzen an.</p>"
"<p></p>"
"<p>Klick op <span style=\" font-weight:600;\">Nakamen</span>, wenn Du fardig büst un wiedermaken wullt.</p>"
"</body></html>"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, label_2)
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, label)
#. +> trunk stable
#: tools/obslistwizard.ui:365 tools/obslistwizard.ui:375
msgid "to"
msgstr "bet"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, DecLabel)
#. +> trunk stable
#: tools/obslistwizard.ui:388
msgid "Dec limits:"
msgstr "Dek-Grenzen:"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, RALabel)
#. +> trunk stable
#: tools/obslistwizard.ui:395
msgid "RA limits:"
msgstr "Rek-Grenzen:"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, CircularRegionText)
#. +> trunk stable
#: tools/obslistwizard.ui:430
msgid ""
"<html><head></head><body>"
"<p>Select objects in a circular region</p>"
"<p></p>"
"<p>On this page, you can limit your observing list to those objects which occupy a particular circular region on the sky.  Specify the circular region by selecting the right ascension (RA) and declination (Dec) coordinates for the center of the circle, and the size of the circle's radius, in Degrees.</p>"
"<p></p>"
"<p>When you are finished, press <span style=\" font-weight:600;\">Next</span> to continue.</p>"
"</body></html>"
msgstr ""
"<html><head></head><body>"
"<p>Objekten ut en Krinkrebeet utsöken</p>"
"<p></p>"
"<p>Op disse Siet kannst Du Dien Kieklist op Objekten ut en besünner Heven-Krinkrebeet ingrenzen. Dat Rebeet giffst Du mit de Rektaszenschoon (Rek) un de Deklinatschoon (Dek) vun den Krink sien Middelpunkt un sien Halfmaat in Graad an.</p>"
"<p></p>"
"<p>Klick op <span style=\" font-weight:600;\">Nakamen</span>, wenn Du fardig büst un wiedermaken wullt.</p>"
"</body></html>"

